       "   'He described water as one of the biggest problems in Iran, saying If we cannot deal with challenges in time, they can become complicated issues.',\n",
       "   'While meteorologicalhydrological droughts act as triggers and intensify the rate of depletion in countrywide groundwater storage, basinscale groundwater depletion in Iran is primarily caused by extensive human water withdrawals.',\n",
